# "Target creature cards from your graveyard": Bot1's graveyard holds an Ornithopter and a Lightning Bolt (Faithless Looting's discards), and Bot2's holds an Elvish Mystic (its
# newest card, discarded to hand size). Neither the instant nor the opponent's creature can be targeted (the refusals); the Ornithopter can (the positive control), and
# goes on top of the library, then back to hand with the draw.

[Bot1 Deck]
Forever Young
Faithless Looting
Mox Jet
Mox Ruby
Ornithopter
Lightning Bolt
Island
Island x8

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x7
Elvish Mystic
Island x10

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Faithless Looting.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Choose(Ornithopter; Lightning Bolt)
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Island.Play
Bot1.Battlefield.Island.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Forever Young.Cast
! Bot1.Target(Lightning Bolt)
! Bot1.Target(Bot2.Graveyard.Elvish Mystic)
Bot1.Target(Ornithopter)
Bot1.Pass

[Expect]
Turn = 3
Bot1.Graveyard = Forever Young; Faithless Looting; Lightning Bolt
Bot2.Graveyard = Elvish Mystic
Bot1.Hand = Island; Island; Island; Ornithopter
